/*VISUAL: A business impact chart showing two timelines. Timeline 1 (Non-modular): Feature Request -> Long Development (6 weeks) -> Extensive Testing (2 weeks) -> Risky Deployment -> 8 weeks total. Timeline 2 (Modular): Feature Request -> Focused Development (2 weeks) -> Isolated Testing (3 days) -> Safe Deployment -> 2.5 weeks total. Include dollar signs showing cost difference*/
