/*VISUAL: Two sequence diagrams side by side. Left: "Synchronous Direct Calls" showing CheckoutService -> PaymentService -> Response, CheckoutService -> InventoryService -> Response, with blocking waits. Right: "Asynchronous Events" showing OrderService -> Event Bus -> multiple consumers (Email, Inventory, Analytics) processing in parallel, no blocking*/
