      children: "The brutal truth about testing: if testing is painful, your architecture is probably wrong. Modularity should make testing easier, not harder. If you find yourself writing tests that are complex, slow, or frequently break, that's a signal your modules aren't properly isolated. Listen to that signal-it's telling you where your architecture needs improvement."
    }), "\n", _jsx(_components.h2, {
